{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23584","headline":"酬微之开拆新楼初毕相报末联见戏之作 · 白居易","name":"酬微之开拆新楼初毕相报末联见戏之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海山郁郁石棱棱，新豁高居正好登。\n南临赡部三千界，东对蓬宫十二层。\n报我楼成秋望月，把君诗读夜回灯。\n无妨却有他心眼，妆点亭台即不能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}